0093:     - Exactly one motif also contains the other marker colors; the remaining motifs contain only the skeleton and anchor.
0094: 
0095:     Rule
0096:     - Use the fully marked motif as the source template.
0097:     - For each incomplete motif, find the unique rotation/reflection and translation that maps the source skeleton and anchor pixel onto the target skeleton and anchor pixel.
0098:     - Stamp all non-skeleton source marker pixels through that alignment, leaving the skeleton cells unchanged.
